              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 6,
                "start": 6
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Norfolk Southern contends that the Due Process Clause entitles it to a rule shielding it from suits in Pennsylvania."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Norfolk Southern",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "5149e9957088896777c37e9b85b7b4f13b1039e3b1ca526cc9a4fff773c15bbc",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-5149e9957088-0001-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 17,
                "start": 17
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Norfolk Southern, the Court\u2019s decision in International Shoe already addresses the jurisdictional issue."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Norfolk Southern",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "5149e9957088896777c37e9b85b7b4f13b1039e3b1ca526cc9a4fff773c15bbc",
