              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 24,
                "start": 24
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Norfolk Southern, norfolk Southern asserts that it has not submitted to Pennsylvania proceedings."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Norfolk Southern",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "5149e9957088896777c37e9b85b7b4f13b1039e3b1ca526cc9a4fff773c15bbc",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-5149e9957088-0003-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 33,
                "start": 33
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Norfolk Southern, the company argues that its conduct and connection with Pennsylvania should make it reasonably anticipate being haled into court there."
        }
